# The port (altspace/). One level up is the fork's own repository, whose .gitignore (upstream's) ignores every *.csproj:
# the golden-vector harness's project file is ours and is kept. (Upstream does not ignore *.json or *.cs.)
!/ts/golden/Golden.csproj

/[Ll]ibrary/
/[Tt]emp/
/[Oo]bj/
/[Bb]uild/
/[Bb]uilds/
/[Ll]ogs/
/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
/[Mm]emory[Cc]aptures/
/[Rr]ecordings/
.utmp/
*.log

# Upstream assets and their data-only stand-in scripts: regenerated by portkit/tools/importer from the fork's own files.
/Assets/Upstream/
/Assets/Upstream.meta

# Built by the kit builder and the script build: never checked in.
/Assets/WebRoot/asset.world
/Assets/WebRoot/asset.world.meta
/Assets/WebRoot/pk-mini-golf.js
*.bundle
*.manifest

# The artifact folder (PortKit/Kit/Export Artifacts): rebuilt, never checked in.
/dist/

# TypeScript side
node_modules/
/ts/dist/
# the golden-vector harness's build output
/ts/golden/bin/
/ts/golden/obj/

# IDE and solution files Unity regenerates (the harness's project file is ours, above)
.vs/
.idea/
*.sln
*.suo
*.user
sysinfo.txt
